@startuml catalogue-model-objects
' SNAPSHOT of 2026-10-27, not maintained (design D-16): the live gap map is docs/use-cases.md.
' The catalogue as instances (rev. 2, 2026-10-27), coloured by what happens to each in this EPIC
' and its roadmap. Classes as in 2026-10-27-catalogue-model.class.puml.
' Planned agent and skill names are provisional (design D-19 decides them).
' Lanes (top to bottom): distribution, knowledge, action, external, intent, assurance.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #546E7A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowFontSize 9
skinparam ObjectBorderColor #455A64
skinparam PackageBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam PackageFontSize 14
skinparam PackageFontStyle bold

title Skillery catalogue: what stays, what changes, what is missing (rev. 2)

