' --- lane order (hidden) ---
cat -[hidden]down- sExec
sExec -[hidden]down- aBuild
aBuild -[hidden]down- exPlug
exPlug -[hidden]down- scen
scen -[hidden]down- tProbes

' --- key links ---
bCore o-- fVoice
fVoice *-- rVoice : will own
sExec ..> fVoice : requires by name
sExpl ..> fVoice : requires by name
bOther o-- aBuild
bOther o-- aCr
aCr *-- tpCr
bSales o-- aSales
bDevops o-- aDevops
aLead ..> aBuild : delegates to
aLead ..> aCr : delegates to
aOffer --> sProp
aOffer --> fVisual
aDesign --> sBig
aDesign --> sCm
aComm --> sComm
aSales --> mOrg
aSales --> rtNow
aDevops --> rtSrv
aPers --> sPlan
aPers --> mVault
aProd --> exSvc
fOdoo --> mOrg
bVault --> exPlug : requires
cfgHooks ..> sOther : enforces rules of
tGherkin --> aCr : proves
tSuites --> tGherkin : runs
dScen --> scen : generated from
cThis --> scen : starts from

legend right
  |= Status |= Meaning |
  | <#C8E6C9> as is | exists and is used unchanged |
  | <#FFE0B2> modified | exists; this EPIC or a named follow-on changes it |
  | <#FFCDD2> missing | does not exist in the repo yet |
  Planned names are provisional (design D-19).
endlegend

@enduml
